  "description": "En Fuego — built for riders who don’t ask permission.\nHit the trail, send it off something questionable, or load it up and disappear into the woods for a few days — the En Fuego lives for that kind of chaos.\n\nWith modern geometry, 29x2.6\" rubber, and your choice of 130mm or 140mm up front, this rig doesn’t just take hits — it laughs at them. Tough when it counts, lively when it matters, and always down for one more loop.\n\nPoint it. Pin it. Pack it. En Fuego is ready. Are you?\n\nLet's talk about bikes! Schedule uninterrupted time to chat about En Fuego. Book time now!\n\nStandard Features:\n\nGrade 9 Seamless Butted 3Al/2.5V Titanium\n\nT47 Threaded Bottom Bracket\n\nUDH Derailleur Hanger (Standard rear derailleur or SRAM Full Mount)\n\n29x2.6 Tire Clearance\n\nWireless and Mechanical Shifting Compatible\n\nTraditional Internal Cable Routing Traditional\n\n130mm and 140mm travel fork compatible\n\n*Frameset includes: Headset, Seat Clamp, Rear Axle\n\nLet's talk about bikes! Schedule uninterrupted time to chat about En Fuego. Book time now!",
